## 10. Scanner Output Fields

When reporting a potential Broken Access Control vulnerability, provide:

- vulnerability: Broken Access Control
- vulnerability_type: Horizontal / Vertical / Missing Function-Level Authorization / IDOR / Unknown
- file: Source file containing the finding
- location: Relevant line number or code location
- evidence: Relevant code fragment
- endpoint: Affected route or API endpoint
- authentication_check: Whether authentication is enforced
- authorization_check: Whether authorization is enforced
- resource_ownership_check: Whether resource ownership is verified
- explanation: Why the access restrictions may be insufficient
- severity: Estimated severity
- confidence: Confidence in the finding
- false_positive_reason: Possible reasons the finding is not exploitable
- remediation: Recommended correction
- cwe: Relevant CWE identifier

